  "body": "Part of #290 (design decisions D1-D10 in its research comment).\n\nDepends on: #541, #542.\n\nOrbits are expanded into CL moves by default so the sim verifies them (D3). The pattern must be listed by the machine (D6), and the radius must not exceed the machine's maximum.\n\n**Done means:** a circular orbit enlarges the cavity by the orbit radius in the sim, an unlisted pattern and an over-radius orbit are refused by name, and the golden is committed.",
